<title>POLAND: MOSTOSTAL ZABRZE SIGNS DM 1.2 MLN DEAL.</title>
<headline>MOSTOSTAL ZABRZE SIGNS DM 1.2 MLN DEAL.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish construction company Mostostal Zabrze SA signed a 1.2-million-marks contract with a German company on carrying out welding works from February to December 1997, the Mostostal said in a statement.</p>
<p>It did not give any other details.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
